<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial;">Hello,<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial;">Per your request, we will be ACHing the full balance due of ${!Case.Total_Payoff__c} from the account on file. <o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial;">If this request is received before 2pm PST the payment will
draft the following business day. If this request is received after 2pm PST the
payment will process in two business days.&nbsp;&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial;">Your response to this email is required to authorize this
charge. Please respond to confirm that you authorize the payment draft above. <o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial;">Thank you,&nbsp;&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><div style="font-family: arial;"><br></div><div style=""><div style="font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><div style="font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">Thank you,&nbsp;</div><div style="font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">Payoff Department</font></div><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial"><b>National Funding</b></font></div><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}</font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}</font></div></div><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">P: (800) 294-1702 | F: (888) 279-7564</font></div><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: arial;">E: payoff@nationalfunding.com</span></div></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
